  "description": "In the realm of IdleMMO, where chaos and conflict reign, Judgement stands as a beacon of order and justice. We are a guild of dedicated players who believe in upholding the principles of fairness and honor. We are not afraid to confront those who seek to disrupt the balance, and we will always strive to protect the innocent.\n\nJudgement welcomes players of all levels who share our values. We offer a supportive and inclusive community where you can grow as a player and make lasting friendships. Whether you are a seasoned veteran or a newcomer to the game, you will find a place among us.",
